SUMMARY:The Early Autumn Earl Bales Leisure Social Walk (with Dinner After
 ) 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n**\\*\\*Kindly
  Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other groups for a very r
 elaxing and fun leisure nature walk through **Earl Bales Park.** A beautif
 ul and tranquil walk just off of Bathurst just south of Sheppard. (Easy ac
 cess by Bathurst Bus and plenty of free parking\, near community centre)\n
 \n\\*We will meet out front the **Earl Bales Community Centre at 4169 Bath
 urst Street**\n\n\\*To find us-enter the park by car or walking and stay i
 n the left lane until you get to the Earl Bales Community Centre (simply p
 ark your car and join us there)\n\\*Washrooms inside\n\\*We will arrive an
 d hang out there from 3:00 pm -3:30 pm as everyone arrives (do your best t
 o arrive at 3:00 pm- then we will begin our leisure nature walk through Ea
 rl Bales park\; eventually returning where we started from\n\nEvent Detail
 s below:\n\nSincerely\,\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Detai
 ls:**\n\n**The Early Autumn Earl Bales Leisure Social Walk (with Dinner Af
 ter)**\nBonus: (Satruday Night Dinner & Beverages After :)\n\n\\*We can st
 op and rest at different spots\, take some lovely scenic photos and share 
 some laughs\n\\*Perhaps play a couple ice breaker games as well to help bu
 ild some bonds\n\\*This is always a great way to casually and naturally ma
 ke new connections and release all your stress as we walk through the park
 \n\n\\*Stick around after if you like as we will go to a Pub/Restaurant at
  1999 Avenue Road\n\n\\*Those taking the bus- plenty of drivers including 
 myself will be happy to drive you to the restaurant after :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event F
 ee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive\nor etransfer in advance to 
 Steveflemming11@gmail.com\n\\*If you can't make walk but wish to take part
  in the mingle after you can email me or text me- event fee still applies\
 n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**T
 ime and Location: Where to meet us?**\n\nArrive between 3:00 pm and 3:30 p
 m\nEarl Bales Community Centre at 4169 Bathurst Street\n\\*stay in left la
 ne when entering the park\, drive to the end where you will see the Commun
 ity Centre (We will be out front the Centre- with washrooms inside the bui
 lding)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n*Thanks for
  reading everyone\; remember to RSVP and see you real soon!* :)\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
