SUMMARY:The Awesome Autumn Karaoke Bash! (Saturday\, September 26th) 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nGet ready t
 o sing\, laugh and celebrate the season at **The Awesome Autumn Karaoke Ba
 sh!** Whether you’re a confident performer\, a casual singalong fan or s
 omeone who simply enjoys great company\, come join us for a lively night o
 f music\, drinks and friendly conversation.\n\n\\*Joined by my other socia
 l groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of frien
 dly peers to enjoy karaoke with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasan
 t: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence 
 - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*
 You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you to th
 e group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking found on 
 residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nStev
 e Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Awesome Autumn Kara
 oke Bash! (Saturday\, September 26th)**\n\n-Autumn is here\, and we’re c
 elebrating with an entertaining evening of karaoke and new connections! Ch
 oose an old favourite\, try something unexpected or relax with a drink whi
 le cheering on the singers.\nYou don’t need a perfect voice or any karao
 ke experience—this event is about having fun\, meeting friendly people a
 nd enjoying the moment. Come alone\, bring a friend or invite a group. We
 ’ll help everyone feel welcome!\n**Evening highlights:**\n\n* Karaoke fa
 vourites from every decade\n* A relaxed and supportive atmosphere\n* Cockt
 ails\, beer\, soft drinks and food available for purchase\n* Opportunities
  to meet new people\n* Plenty of music\, laughter and autumn fun\n* Two mi
 cs for duets as well :)\n\nPlease be respectful of the venue\, performers 
 and fellow guests. Everyone is encouraged to participate\, but singing is 
 always optional.\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Social Club**\n
 \n***\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\
 nor by e transfer: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Remi
 nders:**\n\n-Arrive any time after 7:30 pm (in the back area- great for bo
 ard games\, card games and mingling) (event goes to roughly 12:00 am)\n\n\
 \*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(Two beverage or beverage
  and appetizer minimum to support the venue and this great event)\n\n**Par
 king and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free r
 esidential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(1
 5-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus o
 r uber from the station)
