SUMMARY:**FAMILY FEUD** (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'd like to in
 vite you out for fabulous Sunday afternoon\; with our beloved party game\,
  **Family Feud (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)**\n\n-It's going to 
 be a total blast with a group social game designed to keep us laughing and
  interacting all afternoon\n\n\\*Super easy to learn\, play and have fun- 
 no experience required!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we 
 can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\nEvent Details Below:\n\nSincerely\
 ,\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\n**Details of 
 Event:**\n\n**\\*\\*FAMILY FEUD\\*\\* (Simply the Best Social Game in Town
 !)**\n\n-Lots of laughs in store as we have a great afternoon making new f
 riends and playing **Family Feud** hosted in a unique group vs group forma
 t\n\n-Groups will be divided into groups of 4-6 players\, with multiple ro
 unds played\n\n\\*Chocolate handed out to the winning teams after each rou
 nd we play\n\\*\\* Invite your friends or come on your own\; either way we
  can anticipate a great time!\n***It's all about having fun and laughing a
  lot :)***\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only please) (H
 ST included)\nor in advance by e transfer to **steveflemming11@gmail.com**
 \n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\
 n**Date:** Sunday\, September 27th\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive betwee
 n 2:00 p.m. -2:45 p.m.\nLocation: The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub (1999 Avenue 
 - Just south of 401)\n\\*Great lunch/dinner menu with food/drink specials 
 provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venu
 e)\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue a
 nd free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfir
 kin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n(15-20 minute wal
 k from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the
  station)
