SUMMARY:Music Appreciation from the 1960s to 1980s Social Event! 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nJoin us for
  a fun and interactive Sunday night celebrating the incredible music of th
 e 1960s\, 1970s and 1980s! We’ll listen to great songs\, share memories 
 and opinions\, and talk about the artists and music that helped define thr
 ee unforgettable decades.\nㅤ\nThis is more than just listening to music 
 — everyone is encouraged to participate! Whether you grew up with these 
 songs or simply love discovering great music from the past\, come spend an
  enjoyable evening with friends and fellow music lovers.\nㅤ\n\\*Joined b
 y my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out wi
 th lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we 
 are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 block
 s north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we will be in the back dining ar
 ea)**\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if you like to show you to the grou
 p (simply ask for Steve's event-easy to find)*\n-You'll find it's a cozy\,
  relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential
  side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\
 n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Music Appreciation from the 1960s t
 o 1980s Social Event!**\n(Sunday September 27th)\n\n• Listen to great mu
 sic from the ’60s\, ’70s and ’80s\n• Share your favourite songs\, 
 singers and bands\n• Take part in fun\, interactive music discussions an
 d questions\n• Hear some forgotten gems and rediscover old favourites\n
 • Meet other people who enjoy music and good conversation\nㅤ\nCome lis
 ten\, reminisce\, laugh and enjoy a Sunday night of great music and great 
 company!\n\n**Steve Flemming** has been a DJ since the early 2000s with a 
 lifelong passion for music\, especially from the 1960s\, ’70s and ’80s
 . Raised by a father who was also a DJ during the ’70s and ’80s\, musi
 c has always been a big part of Steve’s life. He enjoys sharing great so
 ngs and bringing people together through music.\n\n**Event Fee:** 5 dollar
 s (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemmin
 g11@gmail.com**\n\\*No extra charge for those attending the earlier events
 \n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 6:30 pm and 8:00 p
 m (if you can-arrive earlier if you like) (please ask for Steve when you a
 rrive\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage o
 r appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transp
 ortation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential park
 ing\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute wal
 k from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the
  station)
